stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RSVP: join or claim
    RSVP --> RECONFIRMED: "still coming?" (reminder 2 h before)
    RSVP --> CANCELLED: leave before start
    RECONFIRMED --> CANCELLED: leave before start
    CANCELLED --> RSVP: join again
    RSVP --> CHECKED_IN: scan host QR (30 min before to 15 min after)
    RECONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN: scan host QR
    CHECKED_IN --> ATTENDED: finalizer, 2 h after end
    RSVP --> NO_SHOW: finalizer, no check-in
    RECONFIRMED --> NO_SHOW: finalizer, no check-in
    NO_SHOW --> ATTENDED: host evidence (scan failed)
    note right of NO_SHOW
        user can appeal for 48 h.
        Accepted: no penalty.
        Rejected or no appeal: counts
        against the reliability score.
    end note
